y & Encryption\n- Enterprise-grade credential encryption service (AES-256-GCM)\n- Automated key rotation with HashiCorp Vault integration\n- Secure credential storage with audit logging\n- Field-level encryption for sensitive data\n- OWASP and compliance standards implementation\n\n## GPU Acceleration\n- GPU-accelerated ML inference with CUDA support\n- Intelligent GPU memory management and optimization\n- Performance monitoring and metrics collection\n- Automatic CPU fallback for graceful degradation\n- TensorRT model optimization\n\n## Infrastructure & DevOps\n- Development environment setup scripts\n- Docker Compose configuration for local development\n- Prometheus monitoring configuration\n- Environment-specific configuration files\n- Database seeding and Prisma integration\n\n## Documentation\n- Comprehensive AI coaching documentation\n- Development setup guide\n- MCP-optimized system summaries\n- Build and deployment plans\n\n## Frontend Updates\n- Updated dependencies and package configurations\n- Enhanced type safety and build optimizations\n\nStats: 66 files changed, 16,496 insertions(+), 186 deletions(-)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"20fa17434d7e32462bd633f1681127cc376aebc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dewscntd/AixG/git/trees/20fa17434d7e32462bd633f1681127cc376aebc3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dewscntd/AixG/git/commits/ef3ff117df65572faac3911d7e2e705b5ae22e8f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10453442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dewscntd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dewscntd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dewscntd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dewscntd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"",