 authentication improvements\n- Enhance video ingestion with async validation services\n\nTechnical improvements:\n- Clean architecture patterns maintained throughout\n- Event-driven communication between services\n- Proper separation of concerns and dependency injection\n- Comprehensive error handling and logging\n- Performance-first design with sub-second response times\n- Scalable microservices architecture\n\nNote: Some TypeScript type definitions need refinement in follow-up commits","tree":{"sha":"d519dd2689134c8db041189b7f4263233875d729","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dewscntd/AixG/git/trees/d519dd2689134c8db041189b7f4263233875d729"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dewscntd/AixG/git/commits/8ac1310eb010703e56fd3c8cc3d84d770e6864d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10453442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dewscntd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dewscntd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dewscntd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dewscntd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Dewscntd","id":10453442,"login":"Dewscntd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDUzNDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dewscntd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dewscntd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dewscntd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dewscntd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dewscntd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dewscntd","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Dewscntd/AixG/commit/8ac1310eb010703e56fd3c8cc3d84d770e6864d3","node_id":"C_kwDOO3yMitoAKDhhYzEzMTBlYjAxMDcwM2U1NmZkM2M4Y2MzZDg0ZDc3MGU2ODY0ZDM","parents":[{"h