ommitter":{"date":"2025-06-07T21:32:25Z","email":"michaelvx@gmail.com","name":"michael"},"message":"feat: implement production-grade deployment and monitoring system\n\n🚀 Production-Grade Infrastructure:\n- GitOps with ArgoCD for declarative deployments\n- Canary deployments with Flagger for progressive delivery\n- Feature flags with Flagsmith for runtime configuration\n- Distributed tracing with Jaeger for observability\n- Comprehensive monitoring with Prometheus/Grafana\n- Incident response automation with PagerDuty\n- Chaos engineering with Litmus for resilience testing\n\n📊 Monitoring & Observability:\n- SLO/SLI definitions with error budget management\n- Burn rate alerting for proactive incident response\n- Custom metrics and dashboards for all services\n- Platform, ML pipeline, and infrastructure monitoring\n- Real-time alerting with escalation policies\n\n🛠️ Operational Excellence:\n- Comprehensive runbooks for incident response\n- Automated diagnostic and response procedures\n- Post-incident review processes\n- Chaos engineering experiments and safety mechanisms\n- Production deployment automation scripts\n\n📚 Complete Documentation:\n- 200+ pages of comprehensive documentation\n- Installation, configuration, and troubleshooting guides\n- API integration examples for multiple languages\n- Best practices and operational procedures\n- Training materials and emergency contacts\n\n🔧 Infrastructure as Code:\n- Terraform modules for all components\n- Kubernetes manifests with production overlays\n- CI/CD pipeline enhancements with GitOps integration\n- Security configurations and RBAC policies\n\nThis implementation provides enterprise-grade reliability with:\n- 99.99% uptime targets\n- Zero-downtime deployments\n- Automated incident response\n- Comprehensive observability\n- Production-ready monitoring and alerting","tree":{"sha":"b49c99e968b24a993439fea9e2fd32f8dcda60fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dewscntd/AixG/git/trees/b49c99e968b24a993439fea9e2fd32f8