04-02T17:52:44Z","email":"maximbel2003@gmail.com","name":"ZverGuy"},"message":"feat(plugins): add centered spinner without blocking overlay\n\nRestore GlobalPluginLoader as a centered fixed-position spinner\n(pointer-events: none) that doesn''t block user interaction.\nPlugins report their loading state to Redux, and the global\nspinner shows when any plugin is loading.\n\nSidebar and header render independently while the spinner\nis visible in the center of the viewport.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: ZverGuy <maximbel2003@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"d0cf6152572be5e5e8e9f46f74a3e5bb24d4f04d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/openapi-ui/git/trees/d0cf6152572be5e5e8e9f46f74a3e5bb24d4f04d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PRO-Robotech/openapi-ui/git/commits/404f4e85a3f3902402caace69854ccb780a74d22","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58953114?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitsunoff/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitsunoff/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitsunoff/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitsunoff/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kitsunoff","id":58953114,"login":"kitsunoff","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4OTUzMTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitsunoff/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitsunoff/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitsunoff/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitsunoff/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitsunoff/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitsunoff","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PRO-Robotech/openapi-ui/commit/404f4e85a3f39