ers/Muppasanipraneeth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muppasanipraneeth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muppasanipraneeth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muppasanipraneeth","id":141117659,"login":"Muppasanipraneeth","node_id":"U_kgDOCGlI2w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muppasanipraneeth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muppasanipraneeth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muppasanipraneeth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muppasanipraneeth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muppasanipraneeth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muppasanipraneeth","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nanakshrestha777/openmrs-esm-patient-chart/commits/24cd98ccb5662f5fbfce4675d81db2a2c1fa96ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-04-23T21:40:43Z","email":"praneeth7077@gmail.com","name":"praneeth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-04-23T21:40:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"(fix) O3-4419: Fix order type filtering in order details table (#2385)\n\nThis PR attempts to fix an issue with the filtering of order types in the Order details table that is outlined [here](https://openmrs.atlassian.net/browse/O3-4419). Specifically, this PR:\n\n- Changes the `orderType` parameter in the order types fetch request API URL  to `orderTypes`.\n- Fixes the range date click handler logic to properly deal with timezone differences.\n- Rename `orders-details-table` to `order-details-table` for consistency.\n- Add type assertions and improve test data completeness.\n\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"56f00bc9c486bea1baa23c339647f2e2c7e08289","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nanakshrestha777/openmrs-esm-patient-chart/git/trees/56f0